<main id="main">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Toronto skyline and CN Tower overlooking Lake Ontario" width="1800" height="1200" fetchpriority="high"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Destination management & event transportation</p><h1 id="hero-title">Remarkable places.<br>Extraordinary moments.<br><em>Every detail, considered.</em></h1><p class="copy">Corporate gatherings, incentive journeys and curated group experiences. We bring your vision to life, from the first idea to the final departure.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn light" href="#enquire">Start planning <span class="arrow">↗</span></a><a class="btn outline" href="#signature">Discover our destinations <span class="arrow">↓</span></a></div></div><div class="hero-bottom"><span>Toronto · Niagara Falls · Beyond</span><span>Thoughtfully curated. Seamlessly executed.</span></div></section>
<div class="ribbon"><div class="wrap">Corporate events <span>✦</span> Incentive travel <span>✦</span> Group experiences <span>✦</span> Event transportation</div></div>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap intro"><p class="eyebrow gold">Your destination. Our attention to detail.</p><div><h2>Great experiences<br>don’t happen by chance.</h2><p class="lead">They begin with an idea, take shape through thoughtful planning, and come together through careful execution. Travaza connects the destination, the experience and the journey—giving your group one considered plan from beginning to end.</p><a class="link" href="#expertise">Discover what we do <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section signature" id="signature"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow gold">Our signature destinations</p><h2>Two destinations.<br>Endless possibilities.</h2></div><p>Toronto’s urban energy. Niagara’s natural drama. Create a stand-alone event or bring both together in one memorable itinerary.</p></div><div class="features"><article class="feature"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," loading="lazy" alt="Toronto city skyline beside the waterfront" width="1000" height="1100"><span class="number">01 / THE CITY</span><div class="content"><p class="eyebrow">Toronto, Ontario</p><h3>The city is<br>your canvas.</h3><p>Leadership retreats, conference programmes, private city discoveries and evenings designed to bring people together.</p><a class="link" href="#enquire" data-destination="Toronto">Plan Toronto <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div></article><article class="feature"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," loading="lazy" alt="The sweeping waterfalls and rising mist of Niagara Falls" width="1000" height="1100"><span class="number">02 / THE ESCAPE</span><div class="content"><p class="eyebrow">Niagara Falls, Ontario</p><h3>A sense<br>of occasion.</h3><p>Falls views, wine country gatherings and curated group experiences. A remarkable setting for rewarding, reconnecting and celebrating.</p><a class="link" href="#enquire" data-destination="Niagara Falls">Plan Niagara <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section dark" id="expertise"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow" style="color:#c5aa75">The Travaza experience</p><h2>One vision.<br>Everything brought together.</h2></div><p>From a single executive transfer to a multi-day destination programme, we shape the details around your people and your purpose.</p></div><div class="services"><article class="service"><span class="num">01</span><div><h3>Corporate events & gatherings</h3><p>Bring your team, clients or delegates together with a programme shaped around your objectives. We coordinate the setting, schedule, experiences and guest movements.</p><p class="tags">Conferences · Executive retreats · Client hospitality · Celebrations</p></div></article><article class="service"><span class="num">02</span><div><h3>Incentive travel</h3><p>Recognise achievement with a journey people will look forward to. Inspiring destinations, shared discoveries and thoughtful moments, planned for your group.</p><p class="tags">Team rewards · Recognition trips · Destination programmes</p></div></article><article class="service"><span class="num">03</span><div><h3>Curated group experiences</h3><p>Connect through culture, food, scenery and time together. We build private itineraries around your interests, pace and occasion, with each experience part of a cohesive whole.</p><p class="tags">Private touring · Culinary experiences · Team outings · Special interest groups</p></div></article><article class="service"><span class="num">04</span><div><h3>Event & executive transportation</h3><p>Keep your programme moving with coordinated arrivals, departures and transfers. From executive movements to group coaches and event shuttles, the journey is part of the experience.</p><p class="tags">Airport transfers · Conference shuttles · Coach charters · Multi-stop logistics</p></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="split"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="An elegantly set reception space ready for a group celebration" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1000"><div class="content"><p class="eyebrow gold">Designed around your people</p><h2>More than an itinerary.<br>A shared experience.</h2><p>A welcome that sets the tone. A dinner that starts a conversation. A day outside the boardroom that brings a team closer. We connect the practical details with the moments that give your gathering meaning.</p><a class="link" href="#enquire">Tell us what you have in mind <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div></section>
<section class="section" id="destinations"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow gold">The destination collection</p><h2>Think beyond<br>the expected.</h2></div><p>From iconic capitals to coastal escapes, explore the places that could inspire your next corporate gathering or group journey.</p></div><p class="dest-intro">Toronto and Niagara Falls are at the heart of our offering. For international programmes, share your brief and we’ll explore the arrangements, experiences and local coordination your group needs.</p><div class="dest-grid" id="destination-grid"></div></div></section>
<section class="process" id="approach"><div class="wrap process-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow gold" style="margin-bottom:16px">Our approach</p><h2>From possibility<br>to perfectly planned.</h2></div><article class="step"><p class="eyebrow">01 / Discover</p><h3>Start with your vision.</h3><p>We listen to your objectives, destination ideas, group needs, dates and budget.</p></article><article class="step"><p class="eyebrow">02 / Curate</p><h3>Make the details count.</h3><p>We shape the itinerary, experiences and transportation into a clear proposal.</p></article><article class="step"><p class="eyebrow">03 / Execute</p><h3>Bring it all together.</h3><p>We coordinate the agreed arrangements and guest movements so every part connects.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section contact" id="enquire"><div class="wrap contact-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow gold">Let’s create something memorable</p><h2>Where will your<br>next idea take you?</h2><p class="description">Tell us about your group and what you want to achieve. We’ll help shape the destination, the experience and the journey.</p><div class="contact-address"><p class="eyebrow">Speak with Travaza</p><a href="mailto:reservations@travaza.com">reservations@travaza.com ↗</a><a href="tel:+18669791181">1-866-979-1181</a></div></div><form id="enquiry-form"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="name">Your name *</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120"></div><div class="field"><label for="company">Company / organisation</label><input id="company" name="company" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="160"></div><div class="field"><label for="email">Email address *</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="254"></div><div class="field"><label for="phone">Phone number</label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="50"></div><div class="field"><label for="service">What are you planning? *</label><select id="service" name="service" required><option value="">Select a service</option><option>Corporate event</option><option>Incentive travel</option><option>Curated group experience</option><option>Event transportation</option><option>Complete destination programme</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="destination">Destination *</label><select id="destination" name="destination" required><option value="">Select a destination</option><option>Toronto</option><option>Niagara Falls</option><option>Toronto & Niagara Falls</option><option>London</option><option>Tokyo</option><option>Paris</option><option>New York</option><option>Milan</option><option>Amalfi Coast</option><option>Los Angeles</option><option>Miami</option><option>Guyana</option><option>Help me choose</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="dates">Preferred dates</label><input id="dates" name="dates" placeholder="Dates or approximate timeframe" maxlength="120"></div><div class="field"><label for="guests">Estimated group size</label><input id="guests" name="guests" type="number" min="1" max="100000" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Number of guests"></div><div class="field full"><label for="details">Tell us about your vision</label><textarea id="details" name="details" placeholder="Your goals, preferred experiences, transportation needs and approximate budget…" maxlength="3000"></textarea></div></div><p class="form-note">This opens a prepared message in your email app. Review it and send it to our team.</p><button class="btn" type="submit">Prepare my enquiry <span class="arrow">↗</span></button><p class="form-status" role="status" id="form-status"></p></form></div></section>
